Answer: Seduction makes her a one-off utility; warlocks summon, seduce, dismiss.

Let's answer concisely.<|start|>assistant to=user<|message|>In Classic the Succubus is a “summon-use-dismiss” pet.

Her Seduction is so good for soloing elites / skipping trash that a Warlock will summon her, Seduce one mob, then dismiss her and go back to a permanent Voidwalker tank. 

You see the Voidwalker all the time because it stays out, you only see the Succubus for the 30 sec she’s on the ground seducing. [end of text]


